      "Context": "[SonarPlugin] LodestoneVerifyWindow.DrawVerification",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
    },
    {
      "Original": "You'll only be able to use Sonar in local mode if not verified by the time this becomes a requirement.",
      "Translated": "如果到此要求生效时仍未通过验证，您将只能在本地模式下使用 Sonar。",
      "Context": "[SonarPlugin] LodestoneVerifyWindow.DrawVerification",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
